=== Gamma(P), two independent routes ===
  sum p_j 2^-j        (k=200)  5.34928793202265755799135261817
  1 + 4 sum 2^-pi(2d) (D=1600) 5.34928793202265755799135261817
  agree to 30 digits: True

=== the erratum: the finite value that was promoted to the limit ===
  Gamma(3,...,73) = 5609051/1048576 = 5.3492078781   <- paper 1, correct
  Gamma(P)                              = 5.34928793202   <- the limit
  they agree to 4 decimals, which is why 5.34920... survived in paper 2

=== positive control: the odd numbers give exactly 3 ===
  1 + 2 sum_{d>=1} 2^-d = 3.0
